Configuring Argo CD with Kustomize
Lab Objectives
By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

Install and configure Argo CD on a Kubernetes cluster
Understand the fundamentals of Kustomize for Kubernetes configuration management
Create Kustomize overlays for different environments
Deploy applications using Kustomize with Argo CD
Manage application configurations through GitOps workflows
Troubleshoot common Argo CD and Kustomize integration issues
Prerequisites
Before starting this lab, you should have:

Basic understanding of Kubernetes concepts (pods, services, deployments)
Familiarity with YAML syntax and structure
Basic knowledge of Git version control
Understanding of containerization concepts
Experience with command-line interface operations
