Conclusion
In this comprehensive lab, you have successfully:

Set up a complete GitOps environment using Argo CD and Kustomize on a local Kubernetes cluster
Mastered Kustomize fundamentals by creating base configurations and environment-specific overlays
Implemented GitOps workflows that automatically deploy changes from Git repositories
Created reusable components using Kustomize components for shared configurations
Configured environment-specific deployments with different resource requirements and configurations
